==Trivia==
Doduo features in two of the {{TCGP|Genetic Apex}} expansion's [[Genetic Apex (TCG Pocket)#Themed Collections|Themed Collections]]:
*the "Touring the Kanto Region" collection; all seven cards show various elements of the [[Kanto]] region. This card's illustration features {{rt|17|Kanto}}, also known as Cycling Road, as depicted in {{game|FireRed and LeafGreen|s}}.
*the "Safari Zone" collection; all featured Pokémon can be found in the [[Kanto Safari Zone]] in Generations {{gen|I}} and {{gen|III}}.

===Origin===
*This card's shiny rare illustration features a {{Shiny}} {{p|Doduo}}.
*{{m|Peck}} is a [[move]] in the [[Pokémon games]] that {{p|Doduo}} can learn.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|X}}.

